  <metadata>
    <name>D15 Abisko → Pajala</name>
    <desc>276 km road, ≈3.7 h riding. Forest wild camp mirrors LWH's bug-infested Swedish forest night – pack a mosquito net. Optional TET gravel between Vittangi and Pajala if a file is supplied in input/tet/.</desc>
